  "label": "Social Obligation",
  "description": "The idea that people feel compelled to attend family events due to social norms or expectations, even if they are not enthusiastic about them. This concept is central to understanding the meme’s humor, as it implies the visit is not out of genuine affection but due to external pressure or the lure of the event (the barbecue).",
